    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Par (agent)",
     "texto": [
      "**Par** usually introduces the agent who carries out an action: **Ce pont est construit par des ouvriers** (this bridge is built by workers).",
      "The agent is not always stated: **Le pont a été construit en 1990** (the bridge was built in 1990)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "De (some verbs and expressions)",
     "texto": [
      "**De** appears often with verbs of feeling or evaluation: **Il est aimé de tout le monde** (everyone loves him).",
      "It is a usage tendency, not an absolute rule; the choice depends on the verb and the expression."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
